WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.640
In <00:00:00.080>the <00:00:00.180>sixteen <00:00:00.910>hundreds,

00:00:01.640 --> 00:00:04.660
the <00:00:01.820>French <00:00:02.040>mathematician <00:00:02.800>Blaise <00:00:03.730>Pascal,

00:00:04.660 --> 00:00:06.560
who <00:00:04.840>built <00:00:05.080>one <00:00:05.400>of <00:00:05.520>the <00:00:05.640>first <00:00:06.000>calculating

00:00:06.560 --> 00:00:10.040
machines, <00:00:08.200>wrote <00:00:08.360>down <00:00:08.740>a <00:00:08.920>strange <00:00:09.240>idea,

